I go into the kitchen.
My new kitchen is small.
But it is very clean.
I look around.
There is a black counter here.
There are some cabinets below the counter.
I open one cabinet.
There are some heavy pots in the cabinet.
Those pots are kept neatly in the cabinet below.
There is a wooden shelf above the counter.
I look at the shelf.
There are some cups on the shelf.
Four small cups are kept there.
There is a small window near the shelf.
I open the window.
Light comes in through the window.
I like this kitchen very much.
